:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Xmas Pudding Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Reindeer Fish Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Jingle Cat Bell (Monthly Event)|Jingle Cat Bell]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] grants higher health, faster attack speed and gains [[Area Attack]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Reindeer Fish Cat can be unlocked in the [[Rare Cat Capsule]] pool once clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] from Chapter One.

